    "detailed_description": "Get ready for chaotic fun!<br>A brain-busting challenge wrapped in cute characters? Here comes a brutally difficult puzzle game!<br><br>This game is a simple action-puzzle where you control four adorable characters to guide them to the goal in each stage.<br><strong>However, you must control all the characters at the same time with a single controller.</strong><br><br>\u201cI wanted to move this one, but that one moved instead!\u201d<br>\u201cMy brain gets it, but my fingers just won\u2019t follow!\u201d<br>You\u2019ll likely find it way harder than you imagine, leaving you squirming in frustration!<br><br>What\u2019s important is:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Quickly figuring out which button controls which character!<br></li><li>Accurately guiding each character to the goal!</li></ul><br>So, if you're confident in your brain and controller skills, why not put them to the test with this game?<br><br>*This game is recommended to be played with a controller, but keyboard controls are also supported.",
    "about_the_game": "Get ready for chaotic fun!<br>A brain-busting challenge wrapped in cute characters? Here comes a brutally difficult puzzle game!<br><br>This game is a simple action-puzzle where you control four adorable characters to guide them to the goal in each stage.<br><strong>However, you must control all the characters at the same time with a single controller.</strong><br><br>\u201cI wanted to move this one, but that one moved instead!\u201d<br>\u201cMy brain gets it, but my fingers just won\u2019t follow!\u201d<br>You\u2019ll likely find it way harder than you imagine, leaving you squirming in frustration!<br><br>What\u2019s important is:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Quickly figuring out which button controls which character!<br></li><li>Accurately guiding each character to the goal!</li></ul><br>So, if you're confident in your brain and controller skills, why not put them to the test with this game?<br><br>*This game is recommended to be played with a controller, but keyboard controls are also supported.",
    "short_description": "Chaos guaranteed! Simple yet extremely challenging brain-bursting action puzzle! Guide 4 cute characters to the goal with a single controller. It\u2019s simple, but things won\u2019t move the way you want them to! We bring you a uniquely frustrating yet fun gaming experience.",
